    "    \"**Date:** November 28, 2025  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"This notebook demonstrates the complete ML pipeline for gold price prediction.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
